WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.820
What does xv6 save during

2
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.080
a context switch? Separate the

3
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.600
saved kernel context from the

4
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.300
