30
00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.400
the stack pointer selects the

31
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.300
suspended kernel stack. The return

32
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.320
address supplies the resumption path

33
00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:09.360
even though it is not

34
00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.580
