59
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.420
With spare physical cores, one

60
00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.000
busy even process does not

61
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.720
establish starvation across the whole

62
00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:08.060
